      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Google Calendar MCP Server Workflow — \n\n**The Problem it solves:** Opening Google Calendar manually to create, check, update, or delete events is something most professionals do multiple times a day. It breaks focus and wastes time that adds up fast.\n\n**The Solution:** One MCP Server Trigger gives an AI agent complete control over Google Calendar — create a new event, update an existing one, fetch one or many events, or delete it entirely — all automatically, the moment a request comes in.\n\n**One line summary:** Your Google Calendar is now fully AI-controlled. No manual scheduling, no app-switching — just ask and it's handled.\n",
